{"@context":["https://schema.org",{"emsenn":"https://emsenn.net/vocab#","skos":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"}],"@id":"https://emsenn.net/letters/2023-12-01-getting-better/","@type":"Article","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"emsenn"},"dateModified":"2023-12-01","datePublished":"2023-12-01","description":"Looking toward tech tools to get better organized, the author reflects on how a disabling accident left them reactive rather than responsive, and describes adopting Todoist and business-productivity methods to rebuild an itinerary for liberation work.","keywords":"organizing, disability, productivity, tools, todoist, letter","name":"Getting Better","publisher":{"@type":"Person","name":"emsenn","url":"https://emsenn.net"},"url":"https://emsenn.net/letters/2023-12-01-getting-better/"}